# The Tenshodo Showdown (windurst 69): the job operands. A WAR at level 40, Mihgo's Amigo completed: not available:
# Nanaa Mihgo's default 76. Completed by GM, As Thick as Thieves available, level 40 < 50, but a WAR: the completed
# section not met: 76.
lists WindurstWoods/Nanaa_Mihgo/onTrigger
char zone=WindurstWoods pos=66.5,-4.75,239.6 job=WAR lvl=40
quest Windurst.MihgosAmigo completed
login
trigger Nanaa_Mihgo+99                         # a WAR: no section: 76
